# =============================================================================
#  ASM-VCI.orch - Audio Scene Management by voice
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller. The Module the workflow is over is the Voice Command Interface (MMC-VCI-V2.5):
#  it is in the driving seat - what the person says becomes a command for an application, and the
#  answer of the application is said back. The application it drives, Audio Scene Management
#  (CAE-ASM-V1.0), is named in the header: the Controller starts it with the Module and connects it
#  by Data Type and Port Number -
#
#      VCI Application Command (MMC-AJI-V2.5)    -> ASM User AJI Input  (MMC-AJI-V2.5:1)
#      ASM User AJI Output     (MMC-AJI-V2.5:1)  -> VCI Application Response (MMC-AJI-V2.5:1)
#
#  The User Agent has no part in that: it binds devices to the Ports it is concerned with, each by
#  Data Type and Port Number, and the Controller decides which Module a Port is of. The Ports the
#  Module has not are the application's.
#
#    what the person gives -
#      OSD-BSO-V1.5:1  what the person says (or types, spoken by the machine's voice)    to VCI
#      OSD-AUO-V1.5:1  a sound the person loads from a file, under the name they give it  to ASM
#
#    what the person is given -
#      OSD-BTO-V1.5:1  the words heard;  OSD-BTO-V1.5:2 and OSD-BSO-V1.5:1  the reply, in text and in speech   from VCI
#      OSD-ASD-V1.5    the audio scene as edited                                                               from ASM
# =============================================================================

workflow ASM-VCI over 1MMC-VCI-V2.5-I01 application 1CAE-ASM-V1.0-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    stream  Voice          (OSD-BSO-V1.5:1)  from device "Voice"
    stream  Sound          (OSD-AUO-V1.5:1)  from device "SoundIn"

    deliver Heard          (OSD-BTO-V1.5:1)  to device "Heard"
    deliver ReplyText      (OSD-BTO-V1.5:2)  to device "ReplyText"
    deliver ReplySpeech    (OSD-BSO-V1.5:1)  to device "ReplySpeech"

    deliver Scene          (OSD-ASD-V1.5)    to device "Scene"
    deliver ObjectOut      (OSD-AUO-V1.5)    to device "Unused"
    deliver ObjectReport   (CAE-UCM-V1.0:1)  to device "Unused"
    deliver SceneReport    (CAE-UCM-V1.0:2)  to device "Unused"
    deliver SpeechOut      (OSD-SPO-V1.5:1)  to device "Unused"
    deliver SpeechSceneOut (OSD-SSD-V1.5)    to device "Unused"
    deliver MultimodalOut  (OSD-MSD-V1.5)    to device "Unused"
    deliver SpeechReport   (CAE-UCM-V1.0:3)  to device "Unused"
    deliver SpeechSceneRep (CAE-UCM-V1.0:4)  to device "Unused"
    deliver MultimodalRep  (CAE-UCM-V1.0:5)  to device "Unused"

    prompt "Hello. Speak to the audio scene, or type, and press Enter. To bring in a sound, press Load a sound."

    loop until Stop:
        wait 1s

on Stop:

    ask Controller to stop
